# Regenerate all demos: npm run demo
Output demo/main.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 880
Set Height 400
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 75ms

Hide
Type `. demo/setup.sh mapped && cd "$HOME" && clear`
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

# a mapped directory picks and launches its account by itself
Type "cd ~/dev/personal/blog"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "claudes"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
Sleep 3.5s
